  "text_pages": [
    "Information for Coordinators | Univerzita Pardubice\nSkip to main content\nInformation for Coordinators\nACADEMIC YEAR 2026/2027\nDear exchange partners,\nwe would like to provide you with the nomination and application deadlines for your students coming to study at the University of Pardubice within Erasmus+ program or MoU for the academic year 2025/2026. The deadlines here below are valid only for study mobility; the internship applications could be submitted continuously during the whole academic year or based on the previous agreement with the faculty coordinator.\nNomination deadlines:\nWinter semester:\n30. 4. 2026\n(visa students)\n15. 6. 2026\n(EU students)\nSummer semester:\n30. 9. 2026\n(visa students)\n15. 11. 2026\n(EU students)\nWe apologize but nominations submitted after the deadline will not be accepted.\nAfter submitting the nomination all information concerning our application procedure will be sent directly to the student´s email address. The application process is online only. The requested documents must be uploaded into the online application form directly by the student. Please remind your students about the 3 important documents listed here below to be uploaded in the online application form in our Portal system:\nLearning agreement\n(submitted via EWP or signed by the sending institution and the student)\nPhoto\n(for the student card)\nEnglish Proficiency Confirmation\n(minimum level B2 is required)\nThe deadlines for submitting the applications and uploading the required documents are as follows.\nApplication deadlines:\nWinter semester:\n10. 5. 2026\n(visa students)\n30. 6. 2026\n(EU students)\nSummer semester:\n10. 10. 2026\n(visa students)\n30. 11. 2026\n(EU students)\nTo be able to assist your students with the course selection, please find here below the link of your\ncourse catalogue for Erasmus students\n.\nShould you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact our coordinator\nMartina Votoupalová\n.\nWe are looking forward to welcoming your students at the University of Pardubice.\nInternational office team\nUniversity of Pardubice\nMap\nContacts\n​\nContacts\nFaculties and Central Services and Facilites\nPanoramic view\nExchange/Erasmus+\nInternational students\nMagazine MY UPCE\nWebsite feedback\nServices\nAccommodation\nLibrary\nDepartment of Physical Education and Sports\nNostrification\nE-shop\nThe Centre for Technology  and Knowledge Transfer\nLanguage Centre\nGuidebook for Internationals\nEuropean University Alliance\n© 2023\nUniversity of Pardubice\n,\nStudentská 95\n,\n532 10\nPardubice 2\nPhone:\n+420 466 036 111, 466 036 112, 466 036 113\nWebmaster\n,\nRSS\nData box ID:\nf5vj9hu\nAccessibility Statement\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0"
